sddm (0.21.0+git20250502.4fe234b-2ubuntu1) questing; urgency=medium

  * Merge from Debian unstable. Remaining changes:
    - Keep the default-display-manager file logic in sddm.postinst.
    - Update Vcs-* to point to Launchpad instead of Salsa.
    - Make sure sddm.service starts at the correct time.
    - Instead of hardcoding the Breeze theme in, allow ubuntu-theme to be
      used in the same fashion Debian's is.
    - Patch to avoid screen overlap or inset.
    - Patch Xsetup script to use bash. Allows previous patch to actually
      run as it requires arrays.
    - d/rules: Explicitly pass QML_INSTALL_DIR to cmake to fix FTBFS on arm64.

 -- Rik Mills <rikmills@kde.org>  Sat, 09 Aug 2025 12:13:25 +0100

sddm (0.21.0+git20250502.4fe234b-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  [ Aurélien COUDERC ]
  * Stop recommending qt6-virtualkeyboard-plugin, it makes non-
    virtualkeyboard aware themes unable to hide the virtual keyboard
    which causes issues for all SDDM themes but KDE’s breeze. Instead
    sddm-theme-breeze and sddm-theme-debian-breeze that can handle this
    correctly were added that recommends in plasma-desktop 4:6.3.6-1. (Closes:
    #1095604)

